OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's paediatric surgery
OL,4,Acould be suspended until December
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaediatric surgery at Dr Gray's
OL,7,FHospital in Elgin might not be restored
OL,8,Funtil the end of December, NHS
OL,9,FGrampian's chief executive has said.
OL,11,FPlanned dental and ear, nose and throat
OL,12,F(ENT) procedures were suspended last
OL,13,Fweek.
OL,15,FIt later emerged that emergency
OL,16,Fsurgeries had been suspended since
OL,17,FJune, a decision that was not made
OL,18,Fpublic at the time.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
