OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's paediatric surgery
OL,4,Acould be suspended until December
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Skaife-Knight has apologised to
OL,7,Fpatients and their families and said
OL,8,Fthe decision to pause the children's
OL,9,Fsurgical services was made on "quality
OL,10,Fand safety grounds".
